
                       geant4-11-04-ref-04
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o Removed G4Exception in G4VSolid default implementation of ComputeDimensions().
   Dispatching for ComputeDimensions() is enabled only for solids where full
   parameterisation is allowed, for all others it is simply disabled and
   performing no actions.
 o Fix in G4VRangeToEnergyConverter to enable the use of UI command such as
   "/cuts/setLowEdge" at the Pre_Init state before initializing the run manager.
 o Optimised computation of mass ratio for ions in G4VEnergyLossProcess.
 o Removed obsolete DNA option 1, 3, 5, 7 and all G4EmDNAPhysics_stationary*
   constructors.
 o Added options for writing scan results to a file from material scanner.

---------- Reference-tag 'Release Notes' -----------


Summarised, the list of changes is the following:

cmake                                            cmake-V11-04-02
-----
- Added first setup for Doxygen-ation of toolkit code.

digits_hits/utils                                detutil-V11-04-00
--------------------
- Added draw() method for Probe.

geometry/management                              geommng-V11-04-06
-------------------
- Updated Reallocate() function in G4GeomSplitter to zero-initialise any slots
  added beyond the previous allocated space, ensuring that uninitialised slots
  in the master array contain null pointers, which then propagate correctly via
  CopyMasterContents() to all workers. Addressing potential crash in MT mode
  in setups with relatively complex geometry being re-initialised between runs
  (see GitLab issue #287).
- Removed G4Exception in G4VSolid default implementation of ComputeDimensions().
  Dispatching for ComputeDimensions() is enabled only for solids where full
  parameterisation is allowed, for all others it is simply disabled and
  performing no actions.
- Use shared_ptr for the shared voxelisation helper in G4GeometryManager
  and simplified the destructor.
- G4PhysicsVolumeStore, G4LogicalVolumeStore, G4SolidStore, G4RegionStore
  added CleanStore private method called from class destructor and from
  method Clean() in order to avoid minor memory leak at exit. The problem
  was in call to the singleton G4GeometryManager in class destructor,
  but this manager may be already deleted and a new instance of it is created
  and never deleted.
- Removed redundant virtual destructor in G4TouchableHistory, as no longer
  necessary. Updated comments and descriptions.
- Fixed error/warning codes in G4VoxelisationHelper and minor cleanup.

geometry/navigation                              geomnav-V11-04-01
-------------------
- Refresh navigator for tracking and mass world in G4MultiNavigator from
  G4PathFinder whenever geometry is modified/rebuilt, to avoid stale pointers.
  Addresses problem report #2714.

geometry/solids/Boolean                          geom-bool-V11-04-01
-----------------------
- Removed redundant specialisations of ComputeDimensions() in Boolean solids.
  Dispatching for ComputeDimensions() is enabled only for solids where full
  parameterisation is allowed, for all others it is simply disabled and
  performing no actions.

