processes/cuts                                   proccuts-V11-04-02
--------------
- In G4VRangeToEnergyConverter, instantiate energy bin vector object only once
  unless it is requested to rebuild by methods such as SetEnergyRange().
  This fix enables the use of UI command such as "/cuts/setLowEdge" at the
  Pre_Init state before initializing the run manager.
  Restore low energy cut limit as it was originally, i.e. 990 eV instead of
  1 keV. It was an overlooked leftover since version 11.0.
  Fixed minor memory leak at exit.

processes/electromagnetic
-------------------------
- dna (emdna-V11-04-03)
  o G4DNAIonisation, G4DNARuddIonisationDynamicModel and
    G4DNARuddIonisationExtendedModel: use updated EM parameters.
- muons (emmuons-V11-04-03)
  o G4TablesForExtrapolator: fixed reported Coverity defect on memory leak
    at exit.
- utils (emutils-V11-04-09)
  o G4ionEffectiveCharge: renamed private method EffectiveCharge(..) to
    ComputeCharge(..); return unitless charge square ratio and effective
    charge in units of charge; added comments to all methods in header file.
  o G4VEnergyLossProcess: optimised computation of mass ratio for ions.
  o G4EmCalculator: fixed reported Coverity defect on computation of ion dEdx.
  o G4EmDataHandler: fixed destruction at exit.
  o G4EmParameters, G4EmLowEParameters: added extra parameters and extended
    information printout for energy transition between DNA and standard models.
    Defined new parameters for e-, protons, and ions.
  o G4EmLowEParameterMessenger: added UI commands for transition energies.

processes/hadronic
------------------
- management (hadr-man-V11-04-00)
  o G4HadronicProcessStore: introduced GetInteractionLength() method.
- models/models/cascade (hadr-casc-V11-04-01)
  o In G4CascadeFinalStateAlgorithm::GenerateCosTheta(), revert to the original
    algorithm for 4-or-higher body generation of cos(theta)b, to fix an
    observed symmetric double bump in the Feynman-x distribution; the update
    also repairs unphysical bumps in the centain spectra of secondary pions
    coming from h+A interactions and does not induce any additional unphysical
    effects in the simulated spectra of secondary pions, protons, and neutrons
    resulting from h+A interactions.
- models/particle_hp (hadr-hpp-V11-04-02)
  o In G4ParticleHPLegendreTable, added protection in the inlined method Init()
    to protect against the possibility of negative input parameter, which
    could cause writing on a zero-size allocated buffer.
- models/parton_string/hadronization (had-hadronization-V11-04-00)
  o G4VLongitudinalStringDecay: fixed wrong MesonWeight indices in the d-dbar
    neutral-meson table in SetMinMasses(); eta and eta' weights now match their
    proper state indices.
- models/parton_string/qgsm (hadr-qgsm-V11-04-02)
  o G4QuarkExchange: fixed a missing line in the target-diffraction branch
    for kaon projectiles. The sampled value x was not stored in TPlusNew, so
    this branch could not complete successfully.
  o G4SPBaryon: fixed wrong antidiquark code in the anti-Delta0 (PDG = -2114)
    QGSM splitting table; changed -2103 to -1103.

run                                              run-V11-04-07
---
- Added options for writing messages to a file. In G4ExceptionHandler and
  G4ExceptionHandlerMessenger, write specified or all warning messages to a
  file rather than on display. In G4MaterialScanner and G4MatScanMessenger,
  write scan results to a file rather than on display.
  Added a UI command to alter the particle type and its momentum for estimating
  the hadronic interaction length.
- Further polishing of the material scanner; in G4MaterialScanner,
  G4MatScanMessenger and G4MSSteppingAction, calculate hadronic interaction
  length from hadron inelastic cross-sections instead of relying on the
  empirical formula of G4Material.

